t/animeadventures/images/3/35/Trait_Nimble.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/90?cb=20220831131940\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/fb/Trait_Sniper.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831133900\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Sniper\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Sniper.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Sniper.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/fb/Trait_Sniper.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/90?cb=20220831133900\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tierList&#95;containerItem\">\n<h3 class=\"tierList_containerItem__name anchor\" id=\"infiniti-C\" style=\"background-color: #ffff8b;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\">C</span></h3>\n<div class=\"tierList&#95;containerItem&#95;&#95;container\">\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/a/ad/Trait_Range.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831131934\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Range\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trait Range.png\" data-image-key=\"Trait_Range.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/a/ad/Trait_Range.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/90?cb=20220831131934\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/f6/Trait_Adept.png/revision/latest?cb=20220831133847\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Trait Adept\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEA